% TOV star (Lupi 2023): polytrope K = 1, Gamma = 2, central rest-mass density 0.129285, in its own tabulated static metric
% (areal radius). t_dyn = 1/sqrt(rho_c) = 2.78, so TimeMax = 20 is about 7 dynamical times. Geometric units (G = c = 1).
InitCondFile                       grhd_tov_ics
ICFormat                           3
OutputDir                          output
TimeLimitCPU                       3600
PartAllocFactor                    2.0
TimeBegin                          0
TimeMax                            20
ComovingIntegrationOn              0
BoxSize                            0
OutputListOn                       0
TimeOfFirstSnapshot                0
TimeBetSnapshot                    1.0
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.05
MinSizeTimestep                    1e-12
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.5
UnitMass_in_g                      1
SofteningGas                       0.001
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.01
CourantFac                         0.2
TimeBetStatistics                  0.01
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.125
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.0025
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
GR_MetricTableFile                 grhd_tov_exact.txt
